flowchart TD
    A[User enters keyword to search product] --> B[Show product results]
    B --> C[User clicks Add to Cart]
    C --> D{Ask user: Continue shopping, View cart, or Checkout?}
    
    D -->|Continue Shopping| A
    D -->|View Cart| E[Display Cart]
    E --> D
    D -->|Proceed to Checkout| F[Ask user to provide address information]
    
    F --> G[User provides address information]
    G --> H{Check if address is complete}
    
    H -->|Incomplete| F
    H -->|Complete| I[Ask user to choose delivery method]
    
    I --> J[User selects delivery method]
    J --> K[Ask user to choose payment method]
    
    K --> L[User selects payment method]
    L --> M[Review cart summary]
    
    M --> N[Ask user to complete order]
    N --> O[Order completed]